OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry, 
OL,6,Fwith variable cloud and light winds. A 
OL,7,Fpatchy frost may form where skies      
OL,8,Fremain clear, as well as a few mist    
OL,9,Fand freezing fog patches.              
OL,11,CThursday:FAnother dry and rather       
OL,12,Fcloudy day. The cloud may occasionally 
OL,13,Flift and break to allow a few glimmers 
OL,14,Fof sunshine, mainly in the afternoon.  
OL,15,FFeeling cold with temperatures below   
OL,16,Faverage.                               
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
