OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FIt is    
OL,6,Fexpected to turn unsettled through     
OL,7,Fthis period, with rain moving in       
OL,8,Fthrough Friday and Saturday. Cloudy    
OL,9,FSunday, with further rain possible     
OL,10,Flater. Breezy, but turning a little    
OL,11,Fmilder.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
